        },
        {
          "text": " Abu Samuel kotwanite, abu da Isirael kere kibworo ŋes, kidaikinai ŋes Rama, oreken, Abu Saul kirenearite luejaas aiokin, ka ikaeudak kakwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.3",
