        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Samuel Saul atiar, “Kanukinyo kilonilonia aitodokun?” Koboŋok Saul ebe, “Ajai ocan luipu noi; naarai ketijiete Ipilisitian, anyou da Edeke kamakaŋ, mam bobo kabononokini, karaida konabin, karaida kotoma airuiasia: kanuka nun ŋes kanyaraunia jo, tetere kitejenuni nueswamai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
